---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Casa de Dios | Iglesia Cristiana">
	
	<!-- Header / Navbar -->
	<header class="navbar">
		<div class="container nav-container">
			<a href="/" class="logo">
				<img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo de Casa de Dios" style="height: 48px; margin-right: 0.5rem; object-fit: contain;" />
				<span class="logo-text">Casa de <span class="text-golden">Dios</span></span>
			</a>
			<nav class="nav-links">
				<a href="#inicio" class="nav-link">Inicio</a>
				<a href="#nosotros" class="nav-link">Nosotros</a>
				<a href="#visitanos" class="nav-link">Contacto</a>
			</nav>
			<div class="nav-socials">
				<a href="https://www.facebook.com/CasaDeDiosTRC2023" target="_blank" class="nav-social-icon" aria-label="Facebook"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"></path></svg></a>
				<a href="https://wa.me/528717709517" target="_blank" class="nav-social-icon" aria-label="WhatsApp"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path></svg></a>
				<a href="tel:+528717709517" class="nav-social-icon" aria-label="Teléfono"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg></a>
			</div>
			<div class="nav-actions">
				<a href="#visitanos" class="btn-pill">
					<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg> <span class="btn-text">Planifica tu Visita</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<main>
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section id="inicio" class="hero">
			<div class="hero-bg"></div>
			<div class="hero-overlay"></div>
			<div class="container hero-content">
				<div class="hero-text animate-fade-up">
					<p class="hero-subtitle">Bienvenidos a casa</p>
					<h1 class="hero-title">Un lugar para encontrar<br/>paz y <span class="text-golden">esperanza</span></h1>
					<p class="hero-desc">Únete a nuestra familia de fe. Experimenta el amor incondicional de Dios y descubre tu propósito a través de Su gracia y poder salvador.</p>
					<div class="hero-cta">
						<a href="#visitanos" class="btn btn-golden">Planificá tu visita</a>
						<a href="#mensajes" class="btn btn-outline" style="color: white; border-color: white;">Últimos Mensajes</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="hero-scroll-indicator">
				<span>Descubre más</span>
				<div class="scroll-arrow">↓</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Misión, Visión y Valores Section -->
		<section id="nosotros" class="section bg-light">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-header text-center animate-fade-up">
					<span class="badge">Nuestra Esencia</span>
					<h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; line-height: 1.3;">Somos una iglesia con revelación, con palabra y con propósito</h2>
				</div>
				
				<div class="features-grid" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
					<div class="feature-card animate-fade-up delay-100">
						<div class="feature-icon">👁️</div>
						<h3>Visión</h3>
						<p>Crear una comunidad de discípulos auténticos y capacitarlos bajo la dirección del Espíritu Santo, para proclamar el evangelio de Cristo Jesús.</p>
						<p class="scripture-ref">MATEO 28:19</p>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-card animate-fade-up delay-200">
						<div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
						<h3>Misión</h3>
						<p>Alcanzar a las familias por medio del Evangelio de Cristo, para que sean restauradas por el poder de Dios, y afirmadas con la dirección del espíritu Santo.</p>
						<p class="scripture-ref">HECHOS 16:31</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="features-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
					<div class="feature-card animate-fade-up delay-300 text-center">
						<div class="feature-icon" style="margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">❤️</div>
						<h3>Nuestros Valores</h3>
						<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-light); font-size: 1.05rem;">
							<p>El primer y más grande mandamiento es, <strong>Amar al señor</strong> Con todo el corazón, con toda el alma, con todas las fuerzas y con todo el entendimiento.</p>
							<p>Ya que nuestro origen es Dios, nuestra vida es Dios y nuestro destino final es Dios. Creemos firmemente que no hay nada más importante que amar al señor.</p>
							<p>Así mismo la palabra de Dios nos enseña que después de amar al señor, lo más importante son las personas. Es por eso que uno de nuestros más grandes valores es el <strong>AMOR</strong>, el amor al señor y el amor al prójimo.</p>
						</div>
						<p class="scripture-ref" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 1.5rem;">MARCOS 12:30-31</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Experience Section with Imagery Placeholder -->
		<section id="experiencia" class="section">
			<div class="container experience-container">
				<div class="experience-content">
					<span class="badge">Únete a nosotros</span>
					<h2>Una Experiencia que Transforma Vidas</h2>
					<p>Cada domingo nos reunimos para celebrar, adorar y recibir una palabra de vida. No importa tu pasado o en qué etapa de la vida te encuentres, en Casa de Dios hay un asiento reservado para ti.</p>
					<ul class="experience-list">
						<li>
							<span class="check-icon">✓</span>
							Adoración contemporánea y profunda
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="check-icon">✓</span>
							Mensajes prácticos basados en la Biblia
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="check-icon">✓</span>
							Un ambiente seguro y divertido para los niños
						</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="#visitanos" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Conoce nuestros horarios</a>
				</div>
				<div class="experience-image-wrapper">
					<!-- Uses a gradient placeholder for draft, representing a warm church gathering -->
					<div class="image-placeholder">
						<div class="glow-orb orb-1"></div>
						<div class="glow-orb orb-2"></div>
						<div class="glass-plate">
							<h3>Horarios</h3>
							<p><strong>Domingos:</strong> 11:00 AM</p>
							<p><strong>Escuelita de niños:</strong> Sábados 11:00 AM</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Visítanos Section -->
		<section id="visitanos" class="section">
			<div class="container visitanos-container" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;">
				<div class="visitanos-info animate-fade-up">
					<span class="badge">Ubicación</span>
					<h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Planifica tu Visita</h2>
					<p style="color: var(--color-text-light); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">Nos encantaría conocerte y compartir contigo. Te esperamos este fin de semana para adorar juntos a Dios.</p>
					
					<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
						<div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
							<span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">📍</span>
							<div>
								<h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.2rem; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-primary);">Dirección</h4>
								<p style="color: var(--color-text-light);">C. Huerto la Joya 8811<br/>Real del Sol, 27087<br/>Torreón, Coah.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
							<span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🕒</span>
							<div>
								<h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.2rem; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-primary);">Horarios</h4>
								<p style="color: var(--color-text-light);">Domingos: 11:00 AM<br/>Escuelita de niños: Sábados 11:00 AM</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/42QzRW33xa1Fvj8KA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary" style="display: inline-flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center;">
						<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg> Abrir en Google Maps
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="visitanos-map animate-fade-up delay-200" style="width: 100%; height: 450px; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
					<iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=C.%20Huerto%20la%20Joya%208811,%20Real%20del%20Sol,%2027087%20Torre%C3%B3n,%20Coah.&t=&z=15&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" width="100%" height="100%" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- CTA / Call to Action -->
		<section class="cta-section">
			<div class="cta-bg-shape"></div>
			<div class="container cta-container">
				<h2>¿Listo para dar el siguiente paso?</h2>
				<p>Ya sea que quieras unirte a un grupo pequeño, servir en un ministerio o simplemente estés buscando respuestas espirituales, estamos aquí para acompañarte.</p>
				<a href="https://wa.me/528717709517" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-golden">Contacta con nosotros por WhatsApp</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<!-- Footer Minimalist Premium -->
	<footer class="footer">
		<div class="container footer-container">
			<div class="footer-brand">
				<a href="/" class="logo" style="color: white;">
					<img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo de Casa de Dios" style="height: 56px; margin-right: 0.5rem; object-fit: contain;" />
					Casa de <span class="text-golden">Dios</span>
				</a>
				<p>Llevando el amor y la luz de Cristo a cada hogar de nuestra ciudad.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="footer-links">
				<h4>Explorar</h4>
				<a href="#inicio">Inicio</a>
				<a href="#nosotros">Nosotros</a>
				<a href="#ministerios">Ministerios</a>
				<a href="#donar">Dar</a>
			</div>
			
			<div class="footer-links">
				<h4>Contacto</h4>
				<a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/42QzRW33xa1Fvj8KA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">📍 C. Huerto la Joya 8811, Real del Sol, 27087 Torreón, Coah.</a>
				<a href="https://wa.me/528717709517" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">📞 +52 871 770 9517</a>
				<a href="https://www.facebook.com/CasaDeDiosTRC2023" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">🌐 Facebook Oficial</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-bottom">
			<p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Casa de Dios. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
		</div>
	</footer>

</Layout>

<style>
	/* Navbar overrides and scoped styles */
	.navbar {
		position: fixed;
		top: 1.5rem;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		width: 95%;
		max-width: 1200px;
		z-index: 1000;
		background: var(--glass-bg);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
		border-radius: 9999px;
		box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
		padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
	}

	.nav-container {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.logo {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-primary);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.2rem;
	}

	.logo-icon {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.nav-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.nav-link {
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		position: relative;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}
	
	.nav-socials {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.2rem;
		align-items: center;
		margin-left: 2rem;
		margin-right: 2rem;
	}
	
	.nav-social-icon {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
	}
	
	.nav-social-icon:hover {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		transform: scale(1.1);
	}

	.btn-pill {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background: var(--color-primary);
		color: var(--color-white);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
		border: 1px solid transparent;
	}

	.btn-pill:hover {
		background: var(--color-primary-light);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.nav-link:hover {
		color: var(--color-primary);
	}

	.nav-link::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		width: 0%;
		height: 2px;
		bottom: -4px;
		left: 0;
		background-color: var(--color-accent);
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
	}

	.nav-link:hover::after {
		width: 100%;
	}

	/* Common Section Padding */
	.section {
		padding: 6rem 0;
	}

	.section-header {
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto 4rem auto;
	}

	.section-header h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	/* Badge */
	.badge {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
		background: rgba(210, 194, 157, 0.2);
		color: var(--color-primary);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
		border-radius: 50px;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	/* Hero Section */
	.hero {
		min-height: 100vh;
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding-top: 5rem; /* offset for navbar */
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.hero-bg {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
		background: url('/images/hero-bg.png') center/cover no-repeat;
		z-index: -2;
	}

	/* Pseudo-element for a subtle divine glow effect */
	.hero-bg::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: -20%; left: 50%;
		width: 80vw; height: 80vw;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(210, 194, 157, 0.25) 0%, transparent 70%);
		border-radius: 50%;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.hero-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(4, 28, 44, 0.75) 0%, rgba(4, 28, 44, 0.85) 100%), url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iOCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI4IiBmaWxsPSIjZmZmIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMDIiLz4KPC9zdmc+');
		z-index: -1;
	}

	.hero-content {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 10;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-white);
	}

	.hero-text {
		max-width: 800px;
	}

	.hero-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 3px;
		color: var(--color-accent-light);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.hero-title {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
		color: var(--color-white);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.1;
		text-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
	}

	.hero-desc {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		max-width: 650px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}

	.hero-cta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.hero-scroll-indicator {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 2rem;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		opacity: 0;
		animation: fadeUp 1s ease-out 1s forwards;
	}

	.scroll-arrow {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		animation: bounce 2s infinite;
	}

	@keyframes bounce {
		0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
		40% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
		60% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
	}

	/* Features Grid */
	.features-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.feature-card {
		background: var(--color-white);
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
		border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
	}

	.feature-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-10px);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
		border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
	}

	.feature-icon {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 60px;
		height: 60px;
		background: var(--color-bg-alt);
		border-radius: 12px;
	}

	.feature-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: var(--color-primary);
	}

	.feature-card p {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
	}

	.scripture-ref {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	
	.scripture-ref::before {
		content: '—';
		color: var(--color-text-light);
	}

	/* Experience Section */
	.experience-container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 4rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.experience-content h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.experience-content p {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.experience-list {
		list-style: none;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.experience-list li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.check-icon {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 24px;
		height: 24px;
		background: rgba(210, 194, 157, 0.25);
		color: var(--color-primary);
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.image-placeholder {
		width: 100%;
		height: 450px;
		border-radius: 30px;
		background: linear-gradient(to right bottom, var(--color-bg-alt), #E2E8F0);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
